# Retire policy 2026-11-20: still in production in 2026 with no announced end; retire dates commented out. Revisit when an end is announced.
# BMW 5 Series G60 four-door saloon, 2023-.
#
# The eighth 5-series: the CLAR-platform car revealed in May 2023 and on sale in
# Britain from October 2023, sharing its body with the i5.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BMW_5_Series_(G60)
#
# Dimensions 5.060 x 1.900 x 1.515 m, wheelbase 2.995 m, G60 saloon, from the
# English Wikipedia dimension box. The Chinese long-wheelbase G68 is not
# modelled.
#
# Colours: the UK colour listing checked in November 2026 (Carwow UK), with the
# codes from a secondary paint-code guide, so the codes here are weaker evidence
# than the availability:
#   Alpine White            300
#   Black Sapphire meta.    475
#   Cape York Green meta.   C5Y
#   Oxide Grey metallic     C4A
# UK availability is established for these; introduction years and prevalence
# are not, and the header says so. Isle of Man Green was not confirmed for the
# ordinary UK G60 and is left out.
# Weights black 3, grey 3, green 2, white 2, total 10, provisional pending the
# central rebase.
#
# Speed 250 km/h, the limit that applies to the 750e-class powertrains; the
# electric i5 is quoted at 240 km/h but the same body is modelled once. Comfort
# 145/548, on the line 330 + 1.5 x 145, a step above the G30's 140/540.
# Class 2.
#
# Dates are road presence: October 2023 intro, retire dates commented out (still in production in 2026)
# fifteen- to eighteen-year tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/bmw-g60.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/bmw-g60.dae (52 objects). References:
# citycars/references/bmw-g60/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons; the flank
# reference is an i5, which shares the body).
#
# Accepted low-poly deviations, recorded rather than corrected: the kidney grille
# is angular, the headlamp and tail lamp treatments are simplified, and the
# glazing sits as a thin band rather than the flush surface of the real car.
# The first pass left three glazing panels standing proud of the roof line and a
# detached door mirror; both were repaired before Stage B and the repaired
# export re-verified, which is why this model has no unspent correction.

obj=citycar
name=BMW5G60(BlackSapphire)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=3
intro_year=2023
intro_month=10
#retire_year=2041
#retire_month=6
speed=250
class=2
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=145
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=548

